#: apps/document-viewer/data/org.helixdesktop.DocumentViewer.metainfo.xml
msgid ""
"Document Viewer shows PDF documents and lets you search, select and copy "
"their text. Read comfortably with thumbnails, an outline, night mode and a "
"presentation mode."
msgstr ""
"Visionneur de documents affiche les documents PDF et vous permet de "
